# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw traffic-log exports from zone-cps.sh.
#
# These contain <src>, <dst>, <serial>, <device_name> and <rule> for EVERY
# session in the window - real addresses off your network. Never commit them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*.xml

# Baseline CSVs generated from your own environment. The one exception is the
# checked-in example, which is synthetic - generated, not captured from a network.
data/*.csv
!data/example-baseline-per-second.csv

# Credentials - PAN_KEY, PAN_USER/PAN_PASS, SNMP community strings.
.env
*.env
*.key
secrets*
